{'symbol': 'MKTX', 'date': '2022-06-01 16:30:00', 'title': 'MARKETAXESS TO PARTICIPATE IN THE PIPER SANDLER GLOBAL EXCHANGE AND FINTECH CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JUNE 01, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MARKETAXESS HOLDINGS INC. (NASDAQ: MKTX), THE OPERATOR OF A LEADING ELECTRONIC TRADING PLATFORM FOR FIXED-INCOME SECURITIES, AND THE PROVIDER OF MARKET DATA AND POST-TRADE SERVICES FOR THE GLOBAL FIXED-INCOME MARKETS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT RICK MCVEY, CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, AND CHRIS CONCANNON, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE PIPER SANDLER GLOBAL EXCHANGE AND FINTECH CONFERENCE ON JUNE 8, 2022.'}